WEBVTT

00:02.752 --> 00:04.921
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:05.004 --> 00:06.631
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.715 --> 00:08.341
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.425 --> 00:11.511
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.594 --> 00:13.555
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.638 --> 00:15.849
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.932 --> 00:17.642
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.726 --> 00:19.978
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.061 --> 00:21.771
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.855 --> 00:24.023
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.107 --> 00:25.859
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.942 --> 00:27.444
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:27.527 --> 00:29.195
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:29.279 --> 00:30.655
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:30.739 --> 00:32.323
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:32.407 --> 00:34.367
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:34.451 --> 00:37.036
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:59.309 --> 01:02.395
Unacceptable!
不可接受！

01:02.479 --> 01:04.647
Pearl!
珍珠！

01:04.731 --> 01:06.858
My friends'll be here in 20
minutes for my slumber party
我的朋友们 20 年后会来
我的睡衣派对几分钟

01:06.941 --> 01:10.945
and you're laying around in
your Tighty-no-Longer-Whities.
而你正躺在
你的紧身衣不再是白色的。

01:11.029 --> 01:15.033
A man works hard
all week to keep
his pants off all weekend.
一个男人努力工作
整个星期都要保持
整个周末他的裤子都脱了。

01:15.116 --> 01:16.910
If you trusted me,
you would leave for the night.
如果你信任我，
你会离开过夜。

01:19.829 --> 01:22.415
You made cork rinds
come out me nose.
你做了软木皮
从我鼻子里出来。

01:22.499 --> 01:24.626
Dad.
爸爸。

01:24.709 --> 01:26.836
Look, I'll stay upstairs
in me room and not interrupt.
看吧，我会留在楼上
在我的房间里，不要打扰。

01:26.920 --> 01:28.046
You promise?
你答应吗？

01:28.129 --> 01:29.297
I promise.
我保证。

01:29.380 --> 01:30.465
Good night, Daddy.
晚安，爸爸。

01:32.050 --> 01:33.259
Good night, sweetie.
晚安，亲爱的。

01:33.343 --> 01:34.803
Dad!
爸爸！

01:34.886 --> 01:36.971
Oh, hi, pumpkin.
哦，嗨，南瓜。

01:37.055 --> 01:38.765
I was just setting out
refreshments for you
and your friends.
我刚刚出发
为您准备的茶点
和你的朋友。

01:38.848 --> 01:40.558
Pearl: Crackers and tap water?
珀尔：饼干和自来水？

01:40.642 --> 01:43.353
You are the cheapest crab alive.
你是世上最便宜的螃蟹。

01:43.436 --> 01:45.271
Now, don't say that.
现在，别这么说。

01:45.355 --> 01:46.898
Here, would your friends
like some pizza?
在这里，您的朋友们
喜欢一些披萨吗？

01:46.981 --> 01:48.149
Well, yeah.
嗯，是的。

01:48.233 --> 01:49.859
Yeah, we would.
是的，我们会的。

01:49.943 --> 01:51.945
Ok, you can have
your allowance early.
好的，你可以有
早点给你津贴。

01:52.028 --> 01:53.238
Pearl: Ketchup?
珀尔：番茄酱？

01:53.321 --> 01:54.656
Mr. Krabs: See?
蟹老板：看到了吗？

01:54.739 --> 01:57.242
You put it on the crackers
你把它放在饼干上

01:57.325 --> 01:59.786
:
And mama mia, you got
one spicy pizza pie.
：
妈妈咪呀，你有
一份辣披萨饼。

01:59.869 --> 02:01.287
Mm... Mm?
嗯……嗯？

02:01.371 --> 02:03.248
Ok, ok, I'm going.
好吧好吧，我这就去。

02:04.415 --> 02:05.583
Oh!
哦！

02:07.126 --> 02:08.127
They're here.
他们来了。

02:08.211 --> 02:09.337
Hi.
你好。

02:10.922 --> 02:12.131
♪ Doo-doo-doo-doo-doo ♪
♪ 嘟嘟嘟嘟嘟 ♪

02:12.215 --> 02:13.591
Dad!
爸爸！

02:13.675 --> 02:15.134
Just putting up the house rules.
只是制定了房屋规则。

02:15.218 --> 02:16.469
Pearl: No dancing.
珀尔：不许跳舞。

02:16.553 --> 02:18.471
No loud music after 7:30.
7:30 后禁止大声播放音乐。

02:18.555 --> 02:20.598
No touching
the root beer cellar.
禁止触摸
根汁啤酒地窖。

02:20.682 --> 02:24.185
And the most important one
of all, no boys allowed.
还有最重要的一个
最重要的是，不允许男孩。

02:24.269 --> 02:26.396
Isn't it glorious?
是不是很光荣呢？

02:27.814 --> 02:29.357
Sweetie?
亲爱的？

02:29.440 --> 02:31.651
You accidentally
locked the door.
你一不小心
锁上了门。

02:31.734 --> 02:35.947
You're not coming back
in this house until after
my slumber party is over.
你不会回来了
在这所房子里直到之后
我的睡衣派对结束了。

02:37.323 --> 02:38.992
This is mutiny!
这是叛变！

02:39.075 --> 02:40.618
Pearl: What are you gonna
do about it?
珍珠：你要做什么
该怎么办？

02:40.702 --> 02:42.078
Take away my allowance?
拿走我的津贴？

02:42.161 --> 02:43.496
Here you go.
干得好。

02:43.580 --> 02:45.081
Open this door, or I'll...
打开这扇门，不然我...

02:51.254 --> 02:56.342
You want to stay here,
at my house, with me?
你想留在这里，
在我家，和我一起吗？

02:56.426 --> 02:58.511
What do you say, boy?
你说什么，男孩？

02:58.595 --> 03:00.597
Yay-hey!
耶-嘿！

03:00.680 --> 03:02.849
Slumber party!
睡衣派对！

03:02.932 --> 03:05.768
Maybe I should just
sleep under the highway.
也许我应该只是
睡在高速公路下。

03:05.852 --> 03:10.356
We can stay up really,
really late, and tell
ghost stories, and trade socks.
我们真的可以熬夜
真的很晚了，告诉
鬼故事和贸易袜子。

03:10.440 --> 03:12.400
Is that what girls
do at slumber parties?
女孩子就是这样吗
在睡衣派对上做什么？

03:12.483 --> 03:14.319
No.
不。

03:14.402 --> 03:15.945
They invite boys over
and destroy the house.
他们邀请男孩过来
并摧毁房子。

03:16.029 --> 03:17.363
They what?
他们什么？

03:17.447 --> 03:18.531
You know how girls are.
你知道女孩子是怎样的。

03:18.615 --> 03:20.366
Uh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

03:20.450 --> 03:22.535
Do you know anything
about girls?
你知道什么吗
关于女孩？

03:24.078 --> 03:25.288
Do I know any...
我知道有没有...

03:25.371 --> 03:26.414
No, but Gary does.
不，但加里有。

03:28.958 --> 03:32.712
Man: We now return
to tonight's scary movie,
"slumber party zombie attack."
男：我们现在回来
今晚的恐怖电影，
“睡衣派对僵尸袭击。”

03:34.339 --> 03:35.506
Girl: Pillow fight.
女孩：枕头大战。

03:36.925 --> 03:38.259
Girl: That tickles!
女孩：好痒啊！

03:38.343 --> 03:39.928
Missed me.
想念我。

03:41.804 --> 03:43.556
Look what they're doing
to that man's house.
看看他们在做什么
到那个男人的家。

03:43.640 --> 03:44.974
Mr. Krabs, it's only a movie.
蟹老板，这只是一部电影。

03:45.058 --> 03:46.309
Quiet, boy.
安静，男孩。

03:46.392 --> 03:47.560
Girl: Boys are here.
女孩：男孩来了。

03:47.644 --> 03:49.479
Hi, girls.
嗨，女孩们。

03:49.562 --> 03:50.855
I brought my
destructive friends.
我带了我的
破坏性的朋友。

03:50.939 --> 03:53.149
Boy: Nice to meet you.
男孩：很高兴认识你。

03:53.232 --> 03:56.069
Boy: Hah, destroying other
people's possessions is fun!
男孩：哈，毁了别人
人们的财产很有趣！

03:59.614 --> 04:00.949
Turn it off!
关掉它！

04:01.032 --> 04:02.200
Turn it off!
关掉它！

04:02.283 --> 04:04.243
I can't take it!
我受不了！

04:04.327 --> 04:05.954
I don't think this is
the scary part yet.
我不认为这是
可怕的部分还没有。

04:06.037 --> 04:09.499
Mr. Krabs: I said, turn it off!
蟹老板：我说了，把它关掉！

04:09.582 --> 04:12.919
Gosh, Mr. Krabs, I never knew
you were scared of zombies.
天哪，蟹老板，我从来不知道
你害怕僵尸。

04:13.002 --> 04:16.047
Not zombies, you barnacle brain.
不是僵尸，是你这个藤壶脑。

04:16.130 --> 04:18.424
Teenagers.
青少年们。

04:18.508 --> 04:19.926
Zombie teenagers?
僵尸青少年？

04:20.009 --> 04:21.386
No!
不！

04:21.469 --> 04:23.221
Pearl and her no-good friends.
珀尔和她的坏朋友。

04:23.304 --> 04:26.015
They're probably destroying
me house right now.
他们可能正在破坏
我现在的房子。

04:26.099 --> 04:27.225
Like this.
像这样。

04:28.559 --> 04:29.769
"I don't care.
“我不在乎。

04:29.852 --> 04:31.104
It's not mine.
这不是我的。

04:31.187 --> 04:32.981
Oh, look.
哦，看。

04:33.064 --> 04:34.399
One of the homeowner's
most prized possessions.
其中一位房主的
最珍贵的财产。

04:34.482 --> 04:35.608
La-di-da."
拉-迪-达。”

04:35.692 --> 04:37.276
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

04:37.360 --> 04:39.112
"Ooh, this'll be fun to destroy.
“哦，破坏这个会很有趣。

04:39.195 --> 04:40.530
Whee!"
呼！”

04:40.613 --> 04:42.448
Now do you get it, boy?
现在你明白了吗，孩子？

04:42.532 --> 04:44.450
Oh, I do, Mr. Krabs.
哦，我愿意，蟹老板。

04:44.534 --> 04:47.578
It must be horrible
to invite people into your home
一定很可怕
邀请人们来到你家

04:47.662 --> 04:49.789
and have them treat
your property with
so little respect.
并让他们对待
您的财产
这么少的尊重。

04:49.872 --> 04:52.750
That's what teenagers do.
这就是青少年所做的事情。

04:52.834 --> 04:54.585
Do you want this
to happen to my house?
你想要这个吗
发生在我家吗？

04:54.669 --> 04:56.587
Gosh, no, Mr. Krabs.
天哪，不，蟹老板。

04:56.671 --> 04:59.215
Then get into pearl's party
and find out what they're doing.
然后参加珍珠的派对
并了解他们在做什么。

04:59.298 --> 05:00.675
Leave it to me, Mr. K.
交给我吧，K 先生。

05:00.758 --> 05:02.760
I've got the perfect disguise.
我有完美的伪装。

05:07.432 --> 05:09.058
Hello.
你好。

05:09.142 --> 05:11.144
Hi, I'm here for
the slumber party.
嗨，我来这里是为了
睡衣派对。

05:11.227 --> 05:12.895
Do I know you?
我知道你？

05:12.979 --> 05:15.898
My name is, um,
"Girlie Teengirl."
我的名字是，嗯，
“少女少女。”

05:15.982 --> 05:17.859
uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

05:17.942 --> 05:21.988
And I just moved here
from, um, "Farawayville."
我刚搬到这里
来自，嗯，“Farawayville”。

05:22.071 --> 05:25.116
I know it's you,
SpongeBob SquarePants.
我知道是你
海绵宝宝。

05:25.199 --> 05:27.410
I don't know what
you're talking about.
我不知道什么
你说的是。

05:29.203 --> 05:31.706
You were sent to spy
on me by my dad.
你被派去做间谍
是我爸爸对我的。

05:31.789 --> 05:33.291
Get him, girls!
抓住他，女孩们！

05:37.045 --> 05:40.673
I am so moving
back to farawayville.
我好感动
回到法拉维维尔。

05:40.757 --> 05:42.050
Who the heck is that?
那到底是谁？

05:42.133 --> 05:45.011
I don't know, but she is ugly.
我不知道，但她很丑。

05:45.094 --> 05:47.096
Now to put on that disguise
I told you about.
现在穿上伪装
我告诉过你。

05:47.180 --> 05:48.222
Tada!
田田！

05:48.306 --> 05:49.307
Huh, huh?
嗯，嗯？

05:49.390 --> 05:50.767
Huh?
啊？

05:50.850 --> 05:52.477
You are one of a kind, boy.
你是独一无二的，男孩。

05:54.020 --> 05:55.521
SpongeBob: Pizza delivery.
海绵宝宝：送披萨。

05:55.605 --> 05:56.689
We didn't order any pizza.
我们没有点任何披萨。

05:56.773 --> 05:58.691
You didn't?
你没有？

05:58.775 --> 06:00.359
SpongeBob, tell 'em
it's from me.
海绵宝宝，告诉他们
这是我发的。

06:00.443 --> 06:01.694
SpongeBob: Your dad sent it.
海绵宝宝：是你爸爸送来的。

06:01.778 --> 06:03.196
It's already paid for.
已经付钱了。

06:05.865 --> 06:09.243
I'd sooner believe space aliens
sent me a free pizza before
I'd believe my dad would.
我宁愿相信外星人
之前给我送了一份免费披萨
我相信我爸爸会的。

06:09.327 --> 06:10.620
Now, who are you?
现在，你是谁？

06:10.703 --> 06:12.538
Um, uh...
嗯，呃...

06:12.622 --> 06:13.873
Hey!
嘿！

06:15.416 --> 06:16.709
Pearl: SpongeBob!
珀尔：海绵宝宝！

06:16.793 --> 06:18.461
They're on to us, Mr. Krabs!
他们来找我们了，蟹老板！

06:18.544 --> 06:19.712
Drive!
驾驶！

06:19.796 --> 06:21.380
Right, boy!
对了，孩子！

06:23.216 --> 06:25.218
I wanted to come
with you, Mr. Krabs.
我想来
和你在一起，蟹老板。

06:25.301 --> 06:26.427
Pearl: Get him!
珀尔：抓住他！

06:28.304 --> 06:29.972
Oh, big surprise.
哦，大惊喜。

06:30.056 --> 06:33.142
Dad was too cheap
to buy real pizza.
爸爸太便宜了
购买真正的披萨。

06:33.226 --> 06:35.436
Mr. Krabs: What's taking
SpongeBob so long?
蟹老板：发生了什么
海绵宝宝这么长？

06:35.520 --> 06:37.605
I'm getting tired
of looking through his stuff.
我累了
翻阅他的东西。

06:39.148 --> 06:40.233
Hello?
你好？

06:40.316 --> 06:41.567
Pizza.
比萨。

06:41.651 --> 06:44.153
I'm sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

06:44.237 --> 06:45.321
I failed you.
我让你失望了。

06:45.404 --> 06:46.823
I know, son.
我知道，儿子。

06:46.906 --> 06:48.157
Ow, Mr. Krabs, that's my eye.
噢，蟹老板，那是我的眼睛。

06:50.409 --> 06:52.286
And it's ice cold too.
而且还很冷。

06:52.370 --> 06:55.456
You should've been back here
in 30 minutes or less.
你应该回到这里
30 分钟或更短的时间内。

07:00.294 --> 07:01.462
Who is it?
是谁？

07:01.546 --> 07:02.672
Piano repair man.
钢琴修理工。

07:04.173 --> 07:06.259
Ok, we'll be right out.
好的，我们马上就出去。

07:06.342 --> 07:09.470
Mr. Krabs, it's working.
蟹老板，成功了。

07:09.554 --> 07:12.265
Have it back by tomorrow, ok?
明天之前还给我好吗？

07:12.348 --> 07:14.892
Maybe we should leave them
alone, Mr. Krabs.
也许我们应该离开他们
单独一人，蟹老板先生。

07:14.976 --> 07:17.186
They seem pretty trustworthy.
他们看起来非常值得信赖。

07:17.270 --> 07:19.480
Mr. Krabs: You get into
that party or you're fired.
蟹老板：你进入
那个聚会，否则你就会被解雇。

07:19.564 --> 07:22.817
Yes, Mr. Krabs.
是的，蟹老板。

07:22.900 --> 07:25.987
Whoever could it be this time?
这次会是谁呢？

07:26.070 --> 07:28.322
SpongeBob: It's me,
SpongeBob SquarePants.
海绵宝宝：是我
海绵宝宝。

07:28.406 --> 07:29.574
Can we talk, Pearl?
我们可以谈谈吗，珀尔？

07:29.657 --> 07:30.950
Whale to sponge?
鲸鱼变成海绵？

07:31.033 --> 07:33.828
Hold the boiling oil.
保持沸腾的油。

07:35.663 --> 07:37.456
what do you want, SpongeBob?
你想要什么，海绵宝宝？

07:37.540 --> 07:40.960
Oh, please let me
stay at your party.
哦，请让我
留在你的聚会上。

07:41.043 --> 07:43.129
Oh, please, oh, please,
oh, please, please, please
噢，拜托，噢，拜托，
哦，拜托，拜托，拜托

07:43.212 --> 07:46.132
please, please, please,
please, please, please.
拜托，拜托，拜托，
拜托，拜托，拜托。

07:46.215 --> 07:47.925
No.
不。

07:48.009 --> 07:50.011
Give me one good reason
why I can't stay.
给我一个充分的理由
为什么我不能留下来。

07:50.094 --> 07:52.180
I can give you
100 million billion reasons.
我可以给你
一亿个理由。

07:52.263 --> 07:54.182
Yeesh, I only asked for one.
是的，我只要求一份。

07:54.265 --> 07:57.476
Reason number one:
You're just like my dad.
原因一：
你就像我爸爸一样。

07:57.560 --> 07:59.270
Really?
真的吗？

07:59.353 --> 08:02.231
Pearl: A no-good, dried-up,
old fuddy-duddy.
珍珠：一种不好的、干涸的、
老古板。

08:03.399 --> 08:05.610
So if I prove I'm fun,
can I stay?
所以如果我证明我很有趣
我可以留下来吗？

08:05.693 --> 08:07.987
Sure, SpongeBob.
当然，海绵宝宝。

08:08.070 --> 08:12.158
If you can prove you're the most
fun person on the planet
in the next 10 seconds
如果你能证明你是最
这个星球上有趣的人
在接下来的10秒内

08:12.241 --> 08:13.492
you can stay.
你可以留下来。

08:13.576 --> 08:16.495
I only need eight.
我只需要八个。

08:16.579 --> 08:17.663
Whoo!
呼！

08:17.747 --> 08:18.831
Party!
派对！

08:18.915 --> 08:20.458
Crank it up!
加大力度！

08:20.541 --> 08:22.376
Pearl: Five seconds.
珀尔：五秒。

08:22.460 --> 08:25.379
These old newspapers
are confetti in fun hands.
这些旧报纸
是有趣手中的五彩纸屑。

08:25.463 --> 08:26.839
Whoo!
呼！

08:26.923 --> 08:28.216
I'm allergic to newsprint.
我对新闻纸过敏。

08:29.926 --> 08:32.386
Two seconds.
两秒钟。

08:36.557 --> 08:39.560
Ok, ok, I got to admit.
好吧好吧，我不得不承认。

08:39.644 --> 08:41.312
That was kind of fun.
那很有趣。

08:41.395 --> 08:42.563
I think he's hurt.
我认为他受伤了。

08:42.647 --> 08:43.940
He's not hurt.
他没有受伤。

08:45.524 --> 08:46.692
See?
看？

08:46.776 --> 08:48.569
Maybe he's a zombie.
也许他是僵尸。

08:48.653 --> 08:50.738
If he comes back as a zombie
and eats my brain
如果他回来时变成僵尸
并吃掉我的大脑

08:50.821 --> 08:53.366
I'm totally not going
to be your friend anymore.
我完全不会去
不再是你的朋友了。

08:53.449 --> 08:56.827
Ooh, Mr. Krabs's
root beer cellar.
哦，蟹老板的
根汁啤酒地窖。

08:56.911 --> 08:58.412
Fun!
乐趣！

09:10.424 --> 09:12.885
Man: We now return to
"slumber party zombie attack."
男：我们现在回到
“睡衣派对僵尸袭击。”

09:12.969 --> 09:14.804
Ah, a zombie.
啊，僵尸。

09:16.347 --> 09:18.391
This movie isn't all that scary.
这部电影并不那么可怕。

09:18.474 --> 09:20.685
Yeah, that zombie
looks totally fake.
是的，那个僵尸
看起来完全是假的。

09:30.778 --> 09:33.364
: Party.
： 派对。

09:34.699 --> 09:36.075
Zombie!
僵尸！

09:41.998 --> 09:43.874
Zombie juice!
僵尸汁！

09:45.209 --> 09:46.377
Run!
跑步！

09:54.677 --> 09:58.055
: Who wants to dance?
: 谁想跳舞？

09:58.139 --> 10:01.017
No, I already have
a zombie boyfriend.
不，我已经有了
僵尸男友。

10:01.100 --> 10:06.772
: Let's boogie.
: 来布吉吧。

10:15.364 --> 10:18.284
What in Neptune's toupee
is going on here?
海王星的假发里有什么
这是怎么回事？

10:20.870 --> 10:21.996
Me knickknacks!
我的小玩意！

10:23.539 --> 10:24.915
Me root beer!
我的根汁汽水！

10:24.999 --> 10:28.252
Me pile of old newspapers.
我一堆旧报纸。

10:30.046 --> 10:32.340
I was maybe gonna
read them someday.
我也许会
有一天读它们。

10:32.423 --> 10:35.634
I knew I shouldn't
have trusted you.
我知道我不应该
已经信任你了。

10:35.718 --> 10:37.428
Trusted me?
信任我吗？

10:37.511 --> 10:40.806
Your employee destroyed
this house.
你的员工被毁了
这所房子。

10:40.890 --> 10:43.017
The only boy at the party.
聚会上唯一的男孩。

10:43.100 --> 10:44.977
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

10:45.061 --> 10:46.687
Well, Mr. Krabs,
you know how boys are.
好吧，蟹老板先生，
你知道男孩子是什么样的。

10:47.897 --> 10:50.274
Ow!
噢！

10:50.358 --> 10:54.236
It's your fault my party
is ruined, and all my friends
have zombie shock syndrome.
我的派对都是你的错
毁了，我所有的朋友
有僵尸休克综合症。

10:54.320 --> 10:57.156
I'm too pretty to be a zombie.
我太漂亮了，不适合当僵尸。

10:57.239 --> 11:02.119
We were fine with a nice,
simple slumber party,
but now, it's gonna cost you.
我们很好，
简单的睡衣派对，
但现在，你要付出代价了。

11:02.203 --> 11:03.913
Cost me what?
花费我什么？

11:03.996 --> 11:05.831
Money.
钱。

11:05.915 --> 11:08.250
Mr. Krabs: No...!
蟹老板：不……！

11:10.336 --> 11:12.505
Pearl: Everyone having
a good time?
珍珠：每个人都有
玩得开心吗？

11:12.588 --> 11:14.507
All: Yeah!
全体：是啊！

11:14.590 --> 11:17.551
Well, you can all thank my dad
for making this possible.
嗯，你们都可以感谢我爸爸
为了使这成为可能。

11:17.635 --> 11:19.261
Thank you, Daddy.
谢谢你，爸爸。

11:22.264 --> 11:25.726
You're welcome, sweetie!
不客气，亲爱的！

11:25.810 --> 11:29.355
Oh, this is so expensive.
哦，这个太贵了。

11:29.438 --> 11:31.816
You're not allowed
any closer, sir.
你不被允许
再近一点，先生。

11:31.899 --> 11:34.568
Mr. Krabs, I think I know
what'll cheer you up.
蟹老板，我想我知道
什么会让你高兴起来。

11:36.112 --> 11:38.447
A mug of ice cold root beer.
一杯冰镇啤酒。

11:38.531 --> 11:41.992
No, SpongeBob, that doesn't
cheer me up at all.
不，海绵宝宝，那不是
让我高兴起来。

11:57.091 --> 12:00.469
Bikini Bottom pet show today.
今天比基尼宠物展。

12:00.553 --> 12:01.887
Good thing I put
those notes there.
好东西我放了
那些笔记在那里。

12:01.971 --> 12:03.597
Otherwise, I could've forgotten.
不然我可能会忘记。

12:03.681 --> 12:06.183
And I wouldn't want to do that
我不想那样做

12:06.267 --> 12:10.563
'cause the Bikini Bottom
pet show is where you got to go
to see the best pets in town.
因为比基尼泳裤
宠物展是你必须去的地方
看看城里最好的宠物。

12:10.646 --> 12:14.191
Not that any other pets stand
a chance against my buddy Gary.
并不是说任何其他宠物都能忍受
有机会对阵我的好友加里。

12:14.275 --> 12:17.903
He's the bestest pet
in the whole world.
他是最好的宠物
在全世界。

12:17.987 --> 12:21.073
Love you, "Gar-bear."
爱你，“加熊”。

12:21.157 --> 12:22.533
Whoa!
哇！

12:22.616 --> 12:23.909
The show starts in an hour.
演出一小时后开始。

12:23.993 --> 12:25.244
Hey, "Gar," time to...
嘿，“加尔”，是时候...

12:25.327 --> 12:26.454
Gary?
加里？

12:27.663 --> 12:28.914
Gary.
加里.

12:28.998 --> 12:30.082
Gary.
加里.

12:30.166 --> 12:31.208
Gary.
加里.

12:31.292 --> 12:33.210
Gary.
加里.

12:33.294 --> 12:34.545
Looks like another beautiful day
here in Bikini Bottom.
看起来又是美好的一天
这里是比基尼泳裤。

12:34.628 --> 12:35.671
Huh?
啊？

12:35.754 --> 12:37.006
Gary.
加里.

12:38.215 --> 12:39.425
Gary.
加里.

12:39.508 --> 12:40.634
Oh, hiya, Squidward.
哦，嗨，章鱼哥。

12:43.304 --> 12:44.346
Gary.
加里.

12:44.430 --> 12:45.473
Gary?
加里？

12:45.556 --> 12:46.807
Gary.
加里.

12:46.891 --> 12:50.436
Gary, there you are.
加里，你来了。

12:50.519 --> 12:53.063
What are you doing here
when today is the day
你在这里做什么
今天是什么时候

12:53.147 --> 12:56.609
we get to show everyone else
you're the best pet
in the whole world?
我们要向其他人展示
你是最好的宠物
在全世界？

12:56.692 --> 12:58.277
Now for a quick checklist.
现在来看一个快速清单。

12:58.360 --> 12:59.528
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

12:59.612 --> 13:00.654
Eye stalk reflexes?
眼柄反射？

13:00.738 --> 13:02.114
Check.
查看。

13:02.198 --> 13:03.866
Slime viscosity.
粘液粘度。

13:12.666 --> 13:15.669
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

13:19.548 --> 13:21.258
Ready.
准备好。

13:25.387 --> 13:26.639
Hi again, Squidward.
再次嗨，章鱼哥。

13:26.722 --> 13:27.932
Hello.
你好。

13:28.015 --> 13:29.808
Check.
查看。

13:29.892 --> 13:33.312
And last, but not least,
a quick undercarriage check.
最后但并非最不重要的一点是，
快速起落架检查。

13:35.397 --> 13:36.815
Whoa, ok.
哇，好吧。

13:36.899 --> 13:40.277
Maybe we'd better skip that one.
也许我们最好跳过那个。

13:40.361 --> 13:41.612
Let's see.
让我们来看看。

13:41.695 --> 13:44.573
Yep, that about does it.
是的，差不多就是这样。

13:46.075 --> 13:47.576
SpongeBob: It's ok, buddy.
海绵宝宝：没关系，伙计。

13:47.660 --> 13:50.371
I'll carry your shell.
我来背负你的壳

13:54.792 --> 13:56.669
Stand up straight.
站直。

13:56.752 --> 13:59.547
Posture is everything
in appearance.
姿势决定一切
在外观上。

13:59.630 --> 14:03.175
Roll over.
滚下。

14:03.259 --> 14:06.512
Your newly-trimmed hairstyles
highlight your regality.
你新修剪的发型
凸显你的威严。

14:06.595 --> 14:08.514
Huh.
呵呵。

14:08.597 --> 14:10.724
People sure seem to treat
their pets differently here.
人们似乎确实对待
他们的宠物在这里有所不同。

14:10.808 --> 14:12.393
Man: That's a good boy, Foofy.
男人：真是个好孩子，福菲。

14:12.476 --> 14:14.645
Look at your luxurious mane.
看看你华丽的鬃毛。

14:14.728 --> 14:16.855
Every self-respecting
snail has one.
每一个有自尊心的人
蜗牛有一个。

14:16.939 --> 14:19.608
Luxurious mane?
奢华的鬃毛？

14:21.110 --> 14:22.361
Ah, yes.
啊，是的。

14:22.444 --> 14:23.612
How could I forget?
我怎么能忘记呢？

14:23.696 --> 14:25.030
Accessories.
配件。

14:25.114 --> 14:26.699
Your diamond-studded leash.
你的镶满钻石的皮带。

14:26.782 --> 14:28.158
I always use an old rope.
我总是使用旧绳子。

14:28.242 --> 14:30.661
Guess that's not good enough.
猜猜这还不够好。

14:30.744 --> 14:35.541
Of course, there's the cherry
on the beauty cake,
the glossy, painted shell.
当然还有樱桃
在美容蛋糕上，
光滑的涂漆外壳。

14:35.624 --> 14:42.506
And last, but not least,
well-maintained oral hygiene.
最后但并非最不重要的一点是，
保持良好的口腔卫生。

14:42.590 --> 14:44.717
Just look at your pearly whites.
看看你的珍珠白就知道了。

14:44.800 --> 14:45.843
Uh, Gary?
呃，加里？

14:48.971 --> 14:50.764
Anyway, we'd best
run along, foofs.
无论如何，我们最好
快跑吧，笨蛋。

14:50.848 --> 14:52.516
Your pedicure is
in half an hour.
你的足疗是
半小时内。

14:52.600 --> 14:53.684
Pedicure?
修脚？

14:55.728 --> 14:56.770
I didn't realize
how much went into this.
我没有意识到
这里面花了多少钱。

14:58.856 --> 15:01.066
Oh, don't be so
protective of me, Gary.
哦，别这样
保护我，加里。

15:01.150 --> 15:03.736
I know I've been
a horrible parent,
but no longer.
我知道我曾经
一个可怕的父母，
但不再是了。

15:03.819 --> 15:07.781
From this moment on forth,
I vow to give my Gary
the utmost in empty frivolity
从这一刻起，
我发誓要把我的加里
空虚至极

15:07.865 --> 15:13.412
to live by the standards
of snail grooming
set forth by that guy.
按标准生活
蜗牛美容
那家伙提出的。

15:13.495 --> 15:14.580
What's up?
这是怎么回事？

15:14.663 --> 15:15.664
No, not you.
不，不是你。

15:15.748 --> 15:17.041
Ok.
好的。

15:17.124 --> 15:18.751
Enough dilly-dallying.
磨蹭够了。

15:18.834 --> 15:20.628
We got to get down to business.
我们得言归正传了。

15:21.962 --> 15:23.422
Hold still, Gary.
坚持住，加里。

15:24.840 --> 15:26.383
Come on, buddy.
来吧，伙计。

15:26.467 --> 15:28.135
Ah, there.
啊，在那里。

15:28.218 --> 15:30.763
Oh, you're like
a little, cuddly present.
哦，你就像
一个可爱的小礼物。

15:34.683 --> 15:37.519
And the  piece de resistance.
以及抵抗力。

15:37.603 --> 15:40.814
Glow-in-the-dark paint.
夜光涂料。

15:40.898 --> 15:42.691
Hey, where are you going?
嘿，你要去哪里？

15:42.775 --> 15:44.360
Gary, wait.
加里，等等。

15:44.443 --> 15:45.694
We got to go back
to the pet show.
我们得回去
去宠物展。

15:48.238 --> 15:51.533
Because we have got to show
those other pets that we are
just as fancy as they are.
因为我们必须展示
我们是其他宠物
就像他们一样花哨。

15:53.035 --> 15:54.787
Oh, come on, Gary.
哦，来吧，加里。

15:54.870 --> 15:56.246
Don't be this way.
别这样。

15:56.330 --> 15:58.874
I'm doing it for you, not me.
我这样做是为了你，不是为了我自己。

16:01.210 --> 16:04.254
That's what I like
to hear, because now,
I can bring this out.
这就是我喜欢的
听到，因为现在，
我可以把这个拿出来。

16:04.338 --> 16:08.592
Your very own studded collar,
with two rows of diamonds.
你自己的镶钉衣领，
有两排钻石。

16:08.676 --> 16:10.678
Here, try it on.
来，试试吧。

16:10.761 --> 16:13.597
Now let's get back
out there and knock 'em
out of their shells.
现在让我们回来
在那里敲他们
从他们的壳里出来。

16:14.973 --> 16:16.392
Hey, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

16:16.475 --> 16:18.268
What you doing?
你在做什么？

16:18.352 --> 16:19.770
Patrick, I'm so glad
you just happened to show up.
帕特里克，我很高兴
你恰好出现了。

16:19.853 --> 16:21.146
: Help me.
： 帮我。

16:28.946 --> 16:30.864
Gary, stop it.
加里，别说了。

16:30.948 --> 16:33.992
I'm only doing this
because I love you.
我只做这个
因为我爱你。

16:35.953 --> 16:37.204
Gary, look.
加里，看。

16:37.287 --> 16:38.497
It's him.
是他。

16:38.580 --> 16:39.873
Come now, foof.
来吧，福夫。

16:39.957 --> 16:41.333
Keep your tail up, up, up.
保持你的尾巴向上，向上，向上。

16:41.417 --> 16:43.711
SpongeBob: Hello!
海绵宝宝：你好！

16:43.794 --> 16:45.671
Sorry to bother you.
很抱歉打扰你。

16:45.754 --> 16:47.297
Just wanted to get your opinion
on my snail Gary.
只是想听听你的意见
在我的蜗牛加里身上。

16:49.508 --> 16:52.636
My boy, you don't seem
to get it, do you?
我的孩子，你看起来并不
得到它，你吗？

16:52.720 --> 16:57.141
There's only one way
to prove your pet's beauty:
By winning the pet contest.
只有一种方法
证明你的宠物的美丽：
通过赢得宠物比赛。

16:57.224 --> 17:02.020
But I wouldn't bother,
seeing as how Foofy and I have
won for the past five years.
但我不会打扰，
看看福菲和我如何
过去五年获胜。

17:04.231 --> 17:05.858
Oh, well, enough mingling
with the common folk.
哦，好吧，混得够多了
与普通民众。

17:05.941 --> 17:09.361
Let's go win our medal, Foof.
让我们去赢得奖牌吧，福夫。

17:14.450 --> 17:15.784
This is it, Gary.
就是这样，加里。

17:15.868 --> 17:18.370
This is our time to shine.
这是我们发光发热的时刻。

17:18.454 --> 17:20.456
Wow, Patrick.
哇，帕特里克。

17:20.539 --> 17:23.041
There's a whole lot of pet
loving going on here today.
有很多宠物
喜欢今天在这里进行的事情。

17:23.125 --> 17:26.003
Yeah, you and Gary
don't have a chance.
是的，你和加里
没有机会。

17:26.086 --> 17:32.009
Excuse me, sir,
but all non-pet owners
must remain behind this rope.
对不起，先生，
但所有非宠物主人
必须留在这根绳子后面。

17:32.092 --> 17:33.719
Now what am I gonna do?
现在我该怎么办？

17:33.802 --> 17:36.221
I'm all alone behind this rope.
我独自一人在这根绳子后面。

17:36.305 --> 17:37.931
Patrick, I'm right here.
帕特里克，我就在这里。

17:38.015 --> 17:40.559
You don't understand, SpongeBob.
你不明白，海绵宝宝。

17:40.642 --> 17:43.729
You'll never understand
what it's like to be alone
behind the red rope.
你永远不会明白
独自一人是什么感觉
红绳后面。

17:46.899 --> 17:48.650
Don't worry, Gary.
别担心，加里。

17:48.734 --> 17:50.569
He'll be back in time
to see us win first place.
他会及时回来的
看到我们赢得第一名。

17:50.652 --> 17:52.863
Now, let's go scope out
the competition.
现在，让我们来看看
比赛。

17:52.946 --> 17:54.448
There it is, Mrs. Squiggles.
就是这样，斯奎格尔斯太太。

17:54.531 --> 17:58.118
Your new hairdo.
你的新发型。

17:58.202 --> 17:59.703
There you go, Muffsies.
就这样吧，莫菲斯。

17:59.787 --> 18:01.872
Oh, isn't that cute?
哦，那不是很可爱吗？

18:05.042 --> 18:07.086
Poor Muffsies.
可怜的莫菲斯们。

18:07.169 --> 18:09.004
Those shades slipped right off
your little eyes.
那些阴影立刻就掉下来了
你的小眼睛。

18:09.087 --> 18:12.424
Luckily, I brought
an extra, smaller pair.
幸好我带了
额外的、较小的一对。

18:16.470 --> 18:18.096
Huh, maybe you need
some shades, huh, Gar?
呵呵，也许你需要
一些色调，嗯，加尔？

18:19.515 --> 18:21.141
Silly boy.
傻孩子。

18:21.225 --> 18:22.768
You're not supposed
to eat the leash.
你不应该
吃皮带。

18:22.851 --> 18:24.186
Come on, buddy.
来吧，伙计。

18:24.269 --> 18:26.980
Now let's try this cape.
现在让我们试试这款斗篷。

18:29.024 --> 18:30.108
Boy, these pets
are gussied up today.
男孩，这些宠物
今天都打扮得漂漂亮亮的。

18:32.486 --> 18:33.737
Maybe I need
a top hat or something
to class it up a bit.
也许我需要
高顶礼帽或其他东西
稍微分级一下。

18:33.821 --> 18:35.155
Gary?
加里？

18:35.239 --> 18:37.032
Oh, thanks for reminding me.
哦，谢谢你提醒我。

18:37.115 --> 18:38.450
I didn't know
your collar was loose.
我不知道
你的衣领松了。

18:40.202 --> 18:41.578
Now let's go get
that top hat, buddy.
现在让我们去获取
那顶礼帽，伙计。

18:53.966 --> 18:55.759
There you go.
就这样吧。

18:57.761 --> 18:59.638
All right, let's see.
好吧，让我们看看。

18:59.721 --> 19:03.267
Ah-ha.
啊哈。

19:03.350 --> 19:05.686
Decent stalk length.
茎长度合适。

19:07.396 --> 19:10.274
Ooh, good hinge action.
哦，铰链动作很好。

19:11.942 --> 19:13.861
Ah, Foofy.
啊，福菲。

19:13.944 --> 19:16.405
Excellent brow stretch.
眉毛伸展效果极佳。

19:16.488 --> 19:19.533
Well-defined eyelid capillaries.
眼睑毛细血管轮廓清晰。

19:19.616 --> 19:22.160
Foofy is looking
as good as ever, Charles.
福菲正在寻找
和以前一样好，查尔斯。

19:22.244 --> 19:25.038
Why, thank you, sir.
为什么，谢谢你，先生。

19:25.122 --> 19:27.499
Ok, let's have
a look-see, shall we?
好吧，我们来吧
我们来看看吧？

19:27.583 --> 19:28.959
Ah, yes.
啊，是的。

19:29.042 --> 19:31.336
Good spacing on the larynx.
喉部间距良好。

19:31.420 --> 19:33.005
Nice gastric chamber.
胃室不错。

19:33.088 --> 19:35.007
All within breed description.
全部符合品种描述。

19:35.090 --> 19:37.009
It's in the bag.
它在袋子里。

19:37.092 --> 19:40.846
Now if we could just
check the undercarriage.
现在如果我们可以
检查起落架。

19:44.474 --> 19:46.143
Gary, no!
加里，不！

19:46.226 --> 19:49.021
Gary, you spit him
out right now.
加里，你吐了他
现在就出去。

19:49.104 --> 19:50.355
I'm sorry.
对不起。

19:50.439 --> 19:52.024
He usually only bites me.
他通常只咬我。

20:23.931 --> 20:26.141
Muffsies, you look angry.
穆菲斯，你看起来很生气。

20:28.185 --> 20:29.895
What's going on?
这是怎么回事？

20:31.939 --> 20:34.274
What a hideous display.
多么可怕的展示啊。

20:34.358 --> 20:37.986
At least I know you'd never
behave like all these heathens,
right, Foofy?
至少我知道你永远不会
像所有这些异教徒一样行事，
对吧，福菲？

20:39.655 --> 20:41.865
Foofy?
福菲？

20:41.949 --> 20:43.241
Foofy!
福菲！

20:54.753 --> 20:55.754
No, Muffsies.
不，莫菲斯。

20:55.837 --> 20:57.005
No!
不！

20:59.841 --> 21:01.802
No, wait, wait.
不，等等，等等。

21:15.399 --> 21:18.110
Foofy, what have you done?
福菲，你做了什么？

21:18.193 --> 21:19.444
What's this about?
这是关于什么的？

21:19.528 --> 21:21.446
Does anyone speak snail?
有人会说蜗牛吗？

21:21.530 --> 21:23.031
I speak a little bit, sir.
我稍微说一点，先生。

21:23.115 --> 21:25.534
I know what they're saying.
我知道他们在说什么。

21:25.617 --> 21:28.787
They're saying, owners, owners,
owners, owners, owners,
owners, owners, owners.
他们说，业主，业主，
业主、业主、业主、
业主，业主，业主。

21:28.870 --> 21:33.291
Please, please, please, please,
please, please, please, please,
don't be this way.
拜托，拜托，拜托，拜托，
拜托，拜托，拜托，拜托，
别这样。

21:33.375 --> 21:35.961
They're saying they don't want
this type of pampering.
他们说他们不想要
这种类型的纵容。

21:36.044 --> 21:40.132
They want to be
treated as companions,
not dress-up dolls.
他们想成为
被视为同伴，
不是装扮娃娃。

21:40.215 --> 21:42.509
They don't want
scratchy outfits.
他们不想要
粗糙的衣服。

21:42.592 --> 21:45.137
They want to  be  scratched.
他们想要被抓伤。

21:45.220 --> 21:48.473
They are protesting
the indignity of wigs
and jewel-encrusted collars
他们在抗议
假发的侮辱
和镶满宝石的项圈

21:48.557 --> 21:53.729
and they want to be free
from superficial and degrading
pageants, like these.
他们想要自由
从肤浅和有辱人格的
选美比赛，比如这些。

21:56.732 --> 21:59.026
You were trying to tell me that
all along, weren't you, Gary?
你试图告诉我
一直以来，不是吗，加里？

22:00.861 --> 22:03.196
Well, I won't
let it happen again.
好吧，我不会
让它再次发生。

22:03.280 --> 22:09.327
Well, I think we can all agree
that this year's
groomers cup goes to...
嗯，我想我们都同意
那今年的
美容师杯去...

22:09.411 --> 22:12.247
SpongeBob and his wonderful pet.
海绵宝宝和他的奇妙宠物。

22:14.291 --> 22:16.585
Did you hear that, Gary?
你听到了吗，加里？

22:16.668 --> 22:21.631
They're rewarding you
for standing up and speaking
out against injustice.
他们正在奖励你
用于站起来讲话
反对不公正。

22:21.715 --> 22:24.509
Maybe these pageants aren't
so superficial after all.
也许这些选美比赛不是
毕竟如此肤浅。

22:24.593 --> 22:26.303
What are you talking about?
你在说什么？

22:26.386 --> 22:28.555
The snail didn't win.
蜗牛没有赢。

22:28.638 --> 22:31.099
I was referring
to your other pet.
我指的是
给你的另一只宠物。

22:31.183 --> 22:33.310
He's so adorable.
他真是太可爱了。

22:33.393 --> 22:34.686
Woof, woof.
汪汪汪。

汪汪汪。